// The Material oracle's specimen app (LLP 1115.001.001 D3). Each specimen is
// its own plan, `specimens/<id>.contract`: headless, the Linux door draws it;
// on a phone, the reader boots it from the launch extra `x_plan` (EXACT_PLAN).
// What this app bakes is shown only when no plan is named.
component App
  view
    column padding=16
      text "Launch with x_plan naming a specimen's plan."
